    "links": [
      54
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 57,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「要是真完了……靈犀怎麼辦？她還在客棧裡等著我回來呢。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=12);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Pain);",
    "links": [
      58
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 58,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「……算了，反正沒事。人還活著，別自己嚇自己。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=15);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      59
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 59,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「可張大叔明明說，旁人受了這傷，十個有九個挺不住。我怎麼覺得……身子反而比以前更輕快？反應靈了，力氣大了，連腦子好像也轉得快些。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=14);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Question);",
    "links": [
      61,
      63,
      65,
      67
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 60,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你睜開眼，膝上的麒麟骰靜靜躺著。方才不論怎麼想，心裡那股亂念，總算沉了下去。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);",
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "entryID": 61,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「大俠怎能倒在這種地方。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      62
    ],
    "Description": "選項1：[信義]"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 62,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「……張大叔把我拉回來，不是讓我躺在客棧發抖的。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,LawChaos,0.05);",
    "links": [
      60
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 63,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「變強了，才好護住靈犀。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      64
    ],
    "Description": "選項2：[仁心]"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 64,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「……若是真能變強，也好。靈犀還在客棧等我，我得有本事護她周全。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Pain);ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,GoodEvil,0.05);",
    "links": [
      60
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 65,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「人還活著就行，怪事以後再說。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      66
    ],
    "Description": "選項3：[通達]"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 66,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「……怪事。算了，就當我天生命好。人還活著，別自己嚇自己。哈哈。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=15);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,LawChaos,-0.05);",
    "links": [
      60
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 67,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「力氣靈了、腦子快了，以後總用得上。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      68
    ],
    "Description": "選項4：[機略]"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 68,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「……管他什麼屍氣不屍氣，力氣大了、腦子轉快了，打架能多幾分便宜，就不虧。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=12);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Idea);ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,GoodEvil,-0.05);",
    "links": [
      60
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 69,
    "actorID": "MC0",
    "text": "觀心觸發：完成赫連娜娜林中奇遇",
    "Sequence": "// TODO: SetQuestState or觀心觸發條件",
    "links": [
      70
    ],
    "Description": "觀心事件入口：觀心：救赫連娜娜"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 70,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（後山深處，三個狗頭人圍著樹上籠子手舞足蹈。籠裡的赫連娜娜一還指揮你擺高手架勢、一邊嘀咕她爹筆記裡的「王霸之氣」怎麼沒用——場面荒唐得不像話。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      71
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 71,
    "actorID": "MC22",
    "text": "[panel=1]「少俠！？你來得正好！……咱倆聯手把它給取了，保證你吃不了虧！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC22,pic=5);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC22,Happy);",
    "links": [
      72
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 72,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（繩索斬斷，她拍著灰爬出籠子，張口便是「算無遺策」、「孺子可教」。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);",
    "links": [
      73
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 73,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你盤膝靜坐，想起赫連姑娘時靈時不靈的羅盤，和她掛在籠子裡還指揮你擺架勢的模樣。這人，你怎麼看？）＊",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=12);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      74
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 74,
    "actorID": "MC0",
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);BeginDiceRoll(Auto,InsightCheck,2);",
    "links": [
      75
    ],
    "Description": "自動洞悉檢定觸發點 (難度2)"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 75,
    "actorID": "MC0",
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      78,
      77
    ],
    "Description": "自動檢定後的空緩衝節點"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 76,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「赫連姑娘的主意，時靈時不靈。王霸之氣那套，狗頭人可不買帳。說她靠譜吧，人掛在籠子裡；說她胡扯吧，又總像知道點什麼。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=12);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      79
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 77,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（骰子溫溫的，沒什麼動靜——念頭還得你自己理。）＊",
    "Sequence": "IsPassDice() == false;",
    "links": [
      76
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 78,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（骰子在掌心跳了跳，像是有回音應了你的念頭。[即時訊息區]: 洞悉檢定成功！洞悉經驗+10。）＊",
    "Sequence": "IsPassDice() == true;ModifyData(FeatExp,Player,Insight,10);",
    "links": [
      76
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 79,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「可當初說後山妖氣沖天、近日宜往一行……這塊她倒沒說錯。後山確實不太對勁。或許，還真有兩下子？」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=14);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Question);",
    "links": [
      81,
      83,
      85,
      87
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 80,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你睜開眼，膝上的麒麟骰靜靜躺著。方才不論怎麼想，心裡那股亂念，總算沉了下去。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);",
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "entryID": 81,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「見人有難，大俠哪能袖手旁觀。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      82
    ],
    "Description": "選項1：[信義]"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 82,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「掛在籠子裡還指揮我擺架勢……但我若轉身就走那也不用在江湖上混了。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,LawChaos,0.05);",
    "links": [
      80
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 83,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「她一個人亂闖後山，放著不管過意不去。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      84
    ],
    "Description": "選項2：[仁心]"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 84,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「嘴上逞強，人卻掛在籠子裡。後山妖氣又邪，她一個人亂闖，遲早出事。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Pain);ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,GoodEvil,0.05);",
    "links": [
      80
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 85,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「羅盤時靈時不靈，隨她折騰吧。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      86
    ],
    "Description": "選項3：[通達]"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 86,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「救也救了，隨她去吧。……反正閒著也是閒著，多個人也挺熱鬧的。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=15);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,LawChaos,-0.05);",
    "links": [
      80
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 87,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「妖氣那塊她沒說錯，跟著瞧瞧不吃虧。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      88
    ],
    "Description": "選項4：[機略]"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 88,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「妖氣她說中了，羅盤說不定還真有用。救都救了，說不定還能蹭點寶……嘻嘻，英雄救美，說出去也好聽。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=5);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Proud);ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,GoodEvil,-0.05);",
    "links": [
      80
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 89,
    "actorID": "MC0",
    "text": "觀心觸發：完成宗緯家瀑布秘境",
    "Sequence": "// TODO: SetQuestState or觀心觸發條件",
    "links": [
      90
    ],
    "Description": "觀心事件入口：觀心：宗緯家石刻"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 90,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（雷鳴般的瀑布、水霧裡縱身一躍。你以為要粉身碎骨，卻被水流送入水簾洞——洞中央立着一尊身披戰甲、手持長矛的女神像，與中原女子的溫婉截然不同。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      91
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 91,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「乖乖……這姐姐長得真彪悍！這身裝備，這肌肉線條……嘖嘖，要是活著，怕是一拳能打死我。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=4);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Shock);",
    "links": [
      92
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 92,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（神像基座上刻滿篆文。你湊近細讀——）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      93
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 93,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（[em2]吾族本居極西之地，受神諭指引，跨越「逆流之河」來到中土。時值戰國亂世，吾族助秦王掃六合，統天下。然秦王欲求長生，窺視吾族血脈之力。吾族不願為奴，遂隱於深山，封印逆流河口，以此神像鎮之。後世有緣人，若得吾族傳承，當以此力守護蒼生，勿蹈秦王覆轍。[/em2]）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      94
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 94,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「極西之地？逆流河？助秦統一？這……這可是驚天大祕密啊！原來歷史書上沒寫的都在這兒呢！」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=4);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Shock);",
    "links": [
      95
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 95,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你盤膝靜坐，水聲在洞外轟鳴。石刻上的字句，一句一句又浮了上來。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=12);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      96
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 96,
    "actorID": "MC0",
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);BeginDiceRoll(Auto,InsightCheck,2);",
    "links": [
      97
    ],
    "Description": "自動洞悉檢定觸發點 (難度2)"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 97,
    "actorID": "MC0",
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      100,
      99
    ],
    "Description": "自動檢定後的空緩衝節點"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 98,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「[em2]極西之地[/em2]、[em2]逆流之河[/em2]……他們不是尋常中原人，是從別處來的。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=12);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      101
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 99,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（骰子溫溫的，沒什麼動靜——念頭還得你自己理。）＊",
    "Sequence": "IsPassDice() == false;",
    "links": [
      98
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 100,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（骰子在掌心跳了跳，像是有回音應了你的念頭。[即時訊息區]: 洞悉檢定成功！洞悉經驗+10。）＊",
    "Sequence": "IsPassDice() == true;ModifyData(FeatExp,Player,Insight,10);",
    "links": [
      98
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 101,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「[em2]助秦王掃六合[/em2]……幫過皇帝打天下，功勞不小；可[em2]秦王欲求長生[/em2]，要的不是感恩，是血脈。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=12);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      102
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 102,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「[em2]不願為奴[/em2]……所以躲進深山，[em2]封印河口[/em2]，用這神像鎮著。不是逃，是守。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=12);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      103
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 103,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「最後那句——[em2]守護蒼生，勿蹈秦王覆轍[/em2]……是留給後來人的。……留給我？」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=14);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Question);",
    "links": [
      105,
      107,
      109,
      111
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 104,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你睜開眼，膝上的麒麟骰靜靜躺著。方才不論怎麼想，心裡那股亂念，總算沉了下去。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);",
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "entryID": 105,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「守護蒼生、勿蹈秦王覆轍——這是託付。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      106
    ],
    "Description": "選項1：[信義]"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 106,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「石刻託的不是尋寶，是守護蒼生。我既然讀到了，往後行走江湖，總不能只管自己撈好處——大俠的路，也得配得上這幾個字。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,LawChaos,0.05);",
    "links": [
      104
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 107,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「助了秦，卻仍不肯為奴……這部族太難。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      108
    ],
    "Description": "選項2：[仁心]"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 108,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「幫人打天下，換來的卻是窺視血脈、逼人為奴。到頭來只能躲在山裡……這世道，對誰都不寬容。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Pain);ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,GoodEvil,0.05);",
    "links": [
      104
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 109,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「幾百年前的舊帳，想破頭也沒用。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      110
    ],
    "Description": "選項3：[通達]"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 110,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「幾百年前的恩怨，我想破頭也想不全。……罷了，字看過了，人還活著，回去跟宗緯大哥討塊烤肉壓壓驚。哈哈。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=15);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,LawChaos,-0.05);",
    "links": [
      104
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 111,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「極西、逆流河、助秦……哪條都是驚天消息。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      112
    ],
    "Description": "選項4：[機略]"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 112,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「極西之地、逆流之河、助秦統一……隨便拎一條出去，都够說書先生講上三天。這祕密，說不定哪天用得上。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=12);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Idea);ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,GoodEvil,-0.05);",
    "links": [
      104
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 113,
    "actorID": "MC0",
    "text": "觀心觸發：完成黑鐵嶺深淵祭壇",
    "Sequence": "// TODO: SetQuestState or觀心觸發條件",
    "links": [
      114
    ],
    "Description": "觀心事件入口：觀心：黑鐵嶺礦坑"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 114,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（雲中廣場上，李四額頭磕得流血，哭喊著：黑鐵嶺吃人了——而三十里外的礦坑裡，符咒剝落的鐵門後，是腐爛與硫磺的濁氣。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      115
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 115,
    "actorID": "李四",
    "text": "「救命啊！救救大山！救救我家媳婦！黑鐵嶺……黑鐵嶺吃人了啊！」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      116
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 116,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（告示板上寫著——[em2]鹽鐵之利，國之大柄[/em2]；[em2]私吞礦石者，斬；私鑄兵器者，族誅[/em2]。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      117
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 117,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（監工日記上寫著——深層岩壁裡挖到[em2]紅色水晶[/em2]，大山說那是「[em2]神[/em2]」的眼睛；工人們在膜拜；最後一頁：[em2]逃不掉了…門被鎖了…大山說，我們都是祭品…[/em2]）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      118
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 118,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（祭壇中央，泥塑小人像額頭嵌著第三隻眼——妖異紅光，像活物般跳動。李大山滿身黑筋，喃喃要獻血給神。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      119
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 119,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你盤膝靜坐，礦坑裡讀過的字句，又一句一句浮了上來。）＊",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=12);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      120
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 120,
    "actorID": "MC0",
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "BeginDiceRoll(Auto,InsightCheck,2);",
    "links": [
      121
    ],
    "Description": "自動洞悉檢定觸發點 (難度2)"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 121,
    "actorID": "MC0",
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      124,
      123
    ],
    "Description": "自動檢定後的空緩衝節點"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 122,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「[em2]鹽鐵專賣[/em2]……礦工連私藏分毫都是死罪。官府鎮壓不住，便封門了事。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=12);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      125
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 123,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（骰子溫溫的，沒什麼動靜——念頭還得你自己理。）＊",
    "Sequence": "IsPassDice() == false;",
    "links": [
      122
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 124,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（骰子在掌心跳了跳，像是有回音應了你的念頭。[即時訊息區]: 洞悉檢定成功！洞悉經驗+10。）＊",
    "Sequence": "IsPassDice() == true;ModifyData(FeatExp,Player,Insight,10);",
    "links": [
      122
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 125,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「[em2]紅色水晶[/em2]……大山說是神的眼睛，工人跟著膜拜。人瘋了，不是一夜之間。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=12);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      126
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 126,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「日記最後寫：[em2]我們都是祭品[/em2]。門從外頭鎖死，裡頭的人出不去。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=11);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Pain);",
    "links": [
      127
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 127,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「李四在村口磕頭……大山、媳婦，還有那些失蹤的礦工。這礦坑吃的，恐怕不只是人。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=12);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      129,
      131,
      133,
      135
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 128,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你睜開眼，膝上的麒麟骰靜靜躺著。方才不論怎麼想，心裡那股亂念，總算沉了下去。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);",
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "entryID": 129,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「妖邪作祟，大俠不能裝作沒聽見。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      130
    ],
    "Description": "選項1：[信義]"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 130,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「黑鐵嶺鬧鬼也好、有神也好，既然來了，就不能只惦記寶貝。行俠仗義，總要有人出手。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,LawChaos,0.05);",
    "links": [
      128
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 131,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「李四一家，還有那些被鎖在礦裡的人。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      132
    ],
    "Description": "選項2：[仁心]"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 132,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「大山被紅光迷了心智，媳婦還在暗室裡撐著。李四在村口哭到額頭流血……這不是傳聞，是活生生的人。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Pain);ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,GoodEvil,0.05);",
    "links": [
      128
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 133,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「官府都封了，我們僥倖活著就好。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      134
    ],
    "Description": "選項3：[通達]"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 134,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「礦坑裡的事，我想破頭也想不全。……罷了，人還活著，回雲中喝口熱茶壓壓驚。哈哈。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=15);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,LawChaos,-0.05);",
    "links": [
      128
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 135,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「不祥之物、赤眼水晶……這裡頭必有緣由。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      136
    ],
    "Description": "選項4：[機略]"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 136,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「挖到不祥之物才封礦，紅水晶還能控人……這種東西，說不定跟江湖上那些『惡神』的傳聞有關。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=12);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Idea);ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,GoodEvil,-0.05);",
    "links": [
      128
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 137,
    "actorID": "MC0",
    "text": "觀心觸發：完成趙王洞祭壇前廳戰鬥",
    "Sequence": "// TODO: SetQuestState or觀心觸發條件",
    "links": [
      138
    ],
    "Description": "觀心事件入口：觀心：趙王洞血煞"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 138,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（血色與黑霧吞沒視線。胸口那股飢餓如野火竄起——想吞掉倒地的妖物，甚至想吞掉一旁的同伴。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      139
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 139,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（腦中有個聲音步步進逼：[em2]吃掉牠們[/em2]。指甲掐進掌心，五臟六腑像要裂開。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      140
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 140,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（最後一關——是徹底屈服，還是咬牙說：[em2]去他的，沒有人可以控制我[/em2]。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      141
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 141,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "「總有一天，你會心甘情願祈求吾的。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      142
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 142,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（飢餓驟退。你撐不住昏死過去。迷濛中，一雙寬大的手把你從地上拉起——）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      143
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 143,
    "actorID": "MC5",
    "text": "「……小子，你能撐到現在，是個漢子。剩下的交給我吧！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC5,pic=8);",
    "links": [
      144
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 144,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你盤膝靜坐，趙王洞裡那股腥甜氣息，又像貼著喉嚨爬了上來。）＊",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=11);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Pain);",
    "links": [
      145
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 145,
    "actorID": "MC0",
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "BeginDiceRoll(Auto,InsightCheck,2);",
    "links": [
      146
    ],
    "Description": "自動洞悉檢定觸發點 (難度2)"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 146,
    "actorID": "MC0",
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      149,
      148
    ],
    "Description": "自動檢定後的空緩衝節點"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 147,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「戰後倒在地上，滿腦子只剩[em2]吃[/em2]。妖物是肉，同伴……竟也變成了散發香氣的血肉。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=11);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Pain);",
    "links": [
      150
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 148,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（骰子溫溫的，沒什麼動靜——念頭還得你自己理。）＊",
    "Sequence": "IsPassDice() == false;",
    "links": [
      147
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 149,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（骰子在掌心跳了跳，像是有回音應了你的念頭。[即時訊息區]: 洞悉檢定成功！洞悉經驗+10。）＊",
    "Sequence": "IsPassDice() == true;ModifyData(FeatExp,Player,Insight,10);",
    "links": [
      147
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 150,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「那股意志勒住喉嚨——[em2]吞噬[/em2]，或者[em2]被吞噬[/em2]。我記不得自己是撐住了，還是已經讓步了半寸。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=12);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      151
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 151,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「洞裡有個聲音說，總有一天我會心甘情願祈求牠。……連是人是鬼都說不清。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=14);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Question);",
    "links": [
      152
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 152,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「醒來人在英豪府，傷口包好了，靈犀哭過一場。……可那股飢餓，真的走了嗎？」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=12);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);",
    "links": [
      154,
      156,
      158,
      160
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 153,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你睜開眼，膝上的麒麟骰靜靜躺著。方才不論怎麼想，心裡那股亂念，總算沉了下去。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);",
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "entryID": 154,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「說我總有一天會祈求牠——我絕對不信。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      155
    ],
    "Description": "選項1：[信義]"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 155,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「我好不容易走出那窮山溝，是要闖出一條俠名的——不是讓洞裡那股餓意替我做主。[em2]去他的，沒有人可以控制我[/em2]……那個聲音說的[em2]總有一天[/em2]？我絕對不信。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,LawChaos,0.05);",
    "links": [
      153
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 156,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「娜娜、雍仔就在旁邊……差一點，我就傷到他們了。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      157
    ],
    "Description": "選項2：[仁心]"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 157,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「最駭人的不是妖物，是腦子裡把同伴當成[em2]食物[/em2]的那一瞬。靈犀還在府裡等我……我怎麼能讓她再哭一次。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=11);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Pain);ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,GoodEvil,0.05);",
    "links": [
      153
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 158,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「醒來人沒事，徐大哥還誇我是漢子。想太多，晚上睡不著。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      159
    ],
    "Description": "選項3：[通達]"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 159,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「昏過去，醒過來，傷好了，茶也喝了。……哈哈，命大就好。洞裡的事，想破頭也想不全。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=15);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,LawChaos,-0.05);",
    "links": [
      153
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 160,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「那個聲音、血煞、麒麟骰……賈詡好像早知道什麼。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      161
    ],
    "Description": "選項4：[機略]"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 161,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「賈詡扔來的竹簡寫[em2]貪念若熾，必反噬其主[/em2]……這趟趙王洞，說不定從頭到尾都在試那顆骰子。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=12);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Idea);ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,GoodEvil,-0.05);",
    "links": [
      153
    ]
  }
]